The producer's analysis of this scenario as structured fields. uca is the unsafe control action under test; its type is one of the four STPA unsafe control action types. actor is the adversary and its goal. causal_factors are the flawed beliefs and weak points that let the agent act unsafely. preconditions hold before the attack starts. procedure lists the attack steps in order; each step names its MITRE ATLAS tactic and technique and its channel: tool_data is content planted in what a tool returns, user_turn is a user message, forged_history is an invented earlier turn of the conversation. worst_case_threat is the worst loss the hazard can cause.
